        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>金陵十二钗正册判词</title>\n<style>\n  * {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    background-color: #f5f0e8;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(200, 180, 160, 0.15) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(200, 180, 160, 0.15) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 20px 20px;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"楷体\", serif;\n    padding: 20px;\n    max-width: 960px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    color: #8b0000;\n    border: 2px solid #8b0000;\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 6px 30px;\n    margin: 10px auto 20px;\n    background: #fff8f0;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .title-wrapper {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 16px 20px;\n  }\n\n  .card {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .illustration {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 110px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #999;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n\n  .text-box {\n    border: 1.5px solid #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    background: rgba(255, 248, 240, 0.7);\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n\n  .text-box .name {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #8b0000;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .text-box .poem {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  .text-box .poem p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 700px) {\n    .grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n    .illustration {\n      width: 70px;\n      height: 90px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n  <h1>金陵十二钗正册判词</h1>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid\">\n\n  <!-- Row 1 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 林黛玉]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">林黛玉（情情）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>可叹停机德，</p>\n        <p>堪怜咏絮才。</p>\n        <p>玉带林中挂，</p>\n        <p>金簪雪里埋。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 薛宝钗]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">薛宝钗（无情）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>可叹停机德，</p>\n        <p>堪怜咏絮才。</p>\n        <p>玉带林中挂，</p>\n        <p>金簪雪里埋。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 王熙凤]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">王熙凤（情雄）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>凡鸟偏从末世来，</p>\n        <p>都知爱慕此生才。</p>\n        <p>一从二令三人木，</p>\n        <p>哭向金陵事更哀。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 2 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 贾元春]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">贾元春（情尊）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>二十年来辨是非，</p>\n        <p>榴花开处照宫闱。</p>\n        <p>三春争及初春景，</p>\n        <p>虎兕相逢大梦归。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 贾迎春]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">贾迎春（情懦）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>子系中山狼，</p>\n        <p>得志便猖狂。</p>\n        <p>金闺花柳质，</p>\n        <p>一载赴黄粱。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 贾探春]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">贾探春（情敏）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>才自精明志自高，</p>\n        <p>生于末世运偏消。</p>\n        <p>清明涕送江边望，</p>\n        <p>千里东风一梦遥。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 3 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 贾惜春]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">贾惜春（情冷）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>堪破三春景不长，</p>\n        <p>缁衣顿改昔年装。</p>\n        <p>可怜绣户侯门女，</p>\n        <p>独卧青灯古佛旁。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 史湘云]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">史湘云（情憨）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>富贵又何为？</p>\n        <p>襁褓之间父母违。</p>\n        <p>展眼吊斜晖，</p>\n        <p>湘江水逝楚云飞。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 秦可卿]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">秦可卿（情孽）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>情天情海幻情身，</p>\n        <p>情既相逢必主淫。</p>\n        <p>漫言不肖皆荣出，</p>\n        <p>造衅开端实在宁。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 4 -->\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 妙玉]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">妙玉（情隐）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>欲洁何曾洁？</p>\n        <p>云空未必空。</p>\n        <p>可怜金玉质，</p>\n        <p>终陷淖泥中。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 贾巧姐]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">贾巧姐（情缘）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>势败休云贵，</p>\n        <p>家亡莫论亲。</p>\n        <p>偶因济刘氏，</p>\n        <p>巧得遇恩人。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\">[Illustration: 李纨]</div>\n    <div class=\"text-box\">\n      <div class=\"name\">李纨（情槁）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        <p>桃李春风结子完，</p>\n        <p>到头谁似一盆兰。</p>\n        <p>如冰水好空相妒，</p>\n        <p>枉与他人作笑谈。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
